<title>USA: Tosco files $1.5 billion shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Tosco files $1.5 billion shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tosco Corp filed a shelf offering Wednesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $1.5 billion in debt securities, common stock, preferred stock and depositary shares.</p>
<p>The company, one of the largest independent refiners and marketers of petroleum products in the United States, said it will use net proceeds for general corporate purposes.  </p>
<p>Tosco, based in Stamford, Conn., said it may use net proceeds to finance its acquisition of Unocal Corp's West Coast petroleum refining, marketing and related supply and transportation assets for $1.4 billion.</p>
</text>
